@page
@model FineUI.Core.Examples.Pages.Other.Compatibility.ModelBindingModel
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "对象绑定与首次加载";
}

@section body {
    <f:SimpleForm ID="SimpleForm1" Title="订单信息" ShowHeader="true" BodyPadding="10">
        <Items>
            <f:TextBox ID="tbxName" For="Data.Name" />
            <f:NumberBox ID="nbxQuantity" For="Data.Quantity" />
            <f:Button ID="btnSubmit" Text="保存订单"
                OnClick="@Url.Page(null, "Save", new { id = Request.Query["id"].ToString() })" OnClickFields="SimpleForm1" />
        </Items>
    </f:SimpleForm>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px">
        <f:Label ID="labResult" Text="等待操作" />
    </div>

}

@section exampleDescription {
<section aria-label="页面描述">
    <p>通过旧 OnPost 的对象参数接收模型表单值，同时保留地址中的订单编号。</p>
    <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-refresh" aria-hidden="true"></i>对照兼容入口的实际结果</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>在<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="SimpleForm1" title="订单信息">订单信息</strong>中，修改姓名与数量，再点击<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="btnSubmit" title="保存订单">保存订单</strong>。<br />结果：后台绑定提交对象，结果显示实际编号、姓名和数量。</li>
    </ul>
    <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>补充说明</h3>
    <ul class="compatibility-notes">
        <li>OnGet 准备表单初值，BindProperty 接收编辑结果。</li>
        <li>回发不会再执行 OnGet；普通绑定模型仍为空时由框架创建对象。</li>
        <li>实际保存前应按当前用户校验订单权限。</li>
    </ul>
    <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>关键属性</h3>
    <ul class="example-description-properties">
        <li><code>For / OnClickFields</code>（<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="SimpleForm1" title="订单信息">订单信息</strong>）：本页保留对应的旧处理入口，参数仍从本次提交值读取，响应更新当前页面控件。</li>
    </ul>
</section>
}
